  "description": "The Macho Man is a cross purist’s dream. It’s a traditional top-tube, cable-routed, 612 Select, steel cross bike with our straight-blade, bi-plane, lugged fork crown and race-proven cross geometry.\n\nThe standard All-City touches are all present: custom head badge, hidden fender mounts, reinforced bottle bosses, signature vertical stainless-steel dropout, brazed-on seat collar, custom BB shell and E.D. coating. We even included a pulley mount for running top or bottom-pull derailleurs.\n\nIt’s a classic steel cross bike that you’ll own and love for years.\n\nCurrently available only as a frameset in the sublime blue / white / fade scheme.",
